hadiths[100]{hadithnumber,text}:
"298","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Zameen mein sab se pehle kaun si masjid rakhi gayi? Aap ne farmaya: Masjid al-Haram. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Phir kaun si? Aap ne farmaya: Masjid al-Aqsa. Main ne arz kiya: Un dono ke darmiyan kitna arsa tha? Aap ne farmaya: Chalees saal. Phir jahan tumhe namaz paye, us ke baad namaz parho, kyunke fazilat isi mein hai."
"299","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe paanch cheezein di gayein jo mujh se pehle Ambiya mein se kisi ko nahi di gayein: Ek mahine ki musafat se rob se meri madad ki gayi. Aur mere liye zameen masjid aur paak karne wali banayi gayi. Phir meri ummat mein se jis shakhs ko namaz paye use chahiye ke namaz parhe. Aur mere liye ghaneematein halal ki gayein. Aur Nabi apni qaum ki taraf khaas taur par bheja jata tha jabke main tamam logon ki taraf bheja gaya hun. Aur mujhe shafa'at di gayi."
"300","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main jami kalimon ke sath bheja gaya hun aur rob se meri madad ki gayi hai. Phir jab main soya tha to mere paas zameen ke khazanon ki kunjiyan layi gayein aur mere hath mein rakh di gayein. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) chale gaye jabke tum use nikalte ho."
"301","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina tashreef laye aur Madina ke upari hisse mein ek mohalle mein utre jinhe Bani Amr bin Auf kaha jata hai. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un mein chaudah raatein thehre. Phir Aap ne Bani Najjar ki taraf bheja to wo talwarein latkaye aaye. To goya main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apni sawari par dekh raha hun, Abu Bakr Aap ke peechhe sawar, aur Bani Najjar ke sardar Aap ke ird-gird, yahan tak ke Aap Abu Ayyub ke sehan mein utre. Aur Aap pasand farmate ke jahan namaz paye wahin namaz parhein, aur bakriyon ke baadon mein namaz parhte. Aur Aap ne masjid banane ka hukm farmaya. Phir Aap ne Bani Najjar ke sardaron ki taraf bheja aur farmaya: Ae Bani Najjar! Mujhe tumhari ye deewar qeemat par do. Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Hum us ki qeemat sirf Allah se talab karte hain. Anas ne kaha: Phir us mein wo tha jo main tumhe batata hun: Mushrikon ki qabrein, us mein khandar, aur us mein khajoor ke darakht. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mushrikon ki qabron ka hukm farmaya to wo khodi gayein, phir khandar ka hukm farmaya to wo barabar kiya gaya, aur khajoor ke darakhton ka hukm farmaya to wo kaate gaye. Phir unhon ne khajoor ke darakhton ko masjid ke Qibla ki taraf qatar mein rakha, aur us ke dono bazoun ko pathar banaya. Aur wo pathar uthate jabke wo rajaz parhte, aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke sath they jabke Aap farma rahe they: Ae Allah! Aakhirat ki bhalayi ke siwa koi bhalayi nahi, phir Ansar aur Muhajirin ko bakhsh de."
"302","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Bait al-Maqdis ki taraf solah ya satrah mahine namaz parhi. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) pasand farmate ke Aap Kaaba ki taraf mutawajjah hon. To Allah ne ye nazil farmaya [beshak hum tumhare chehre ka aasman mein phirna dekhte hain]. Phir Aap Kaaba ki taraf mutawajjah hue. Aur logon mein se bewaqoofon ne kaha, jo Yahood hain: Unhe un ke Qibla se kis ne pher diya jis par wo they? Kaho ke mashriq aur maghrib Allah ke hain, Wo jise chahta hai seedhe raste ki hidayat deta hai. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek shakhs ne namaz parhi, phir namaz ke baad nikla. Phir Ansar ki ek qaum par guzra jo Asr ki namaz mein Bait al-Maqdis ki taraf namaz parh rahe they. To us ne kaha jabke wo gawahi deta tha ke us ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath namaz parhi hai aur Aap Kaaba ki taraf mutawajjah hue hain. Phir qaum hati yahan tak ke Kaaba ki taraf mutawajjah ho gayi."
"303","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Bait al-Maqdis ki taraf solah ya satrah mahine namaz parhi. Phir hum Qibla ki taraf pher diye gaye."
"304","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab log Quba mein Fajr ki namaz mein they to un ke paas aane wala aaya. To us ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par aaj raat Quran nazil hua hai, aur Aap ko hukm diya gaya hai ke Aap Kaaba ki taraf munh karein. To tum us ki taraf munh karo. Aur un ke chehre Sham ki taraf they. Phir wo Kaaba ki taraf ghoom gaye."
"305","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Umm Habiba aur Umm Salama ne ek girja ka zikr kiya jo unhon ne Habsha mein dekha tha, us mein tasweerein thein. To unhon ne is ka Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo aise they ke jab un mein saleh shakhs hota aur mar jata to us ki qabr par masjid banate aur us mein ye tasweerein banate. To wahi Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek makhlooq mein sab se bure honge."
"306","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne apni us bimari mein farmaya jis mein Aap ki wafat hui: Allah Yahood aur Nasara par lanat kare, unhon ne apne Ambiya ki qabron ko masjidein banaya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur agar ye na hota to Aap ki qabr zahir ki jati, magar mujhe dar hai ke use masjid bana liya jayega."
"307","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Yahood se lade, unhon ne apne Ambiya ki qabron ko masjidein banaya."
"308","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha aur Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, un dono ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par nazع tari hua to Aap apni ek chadar apne chehre par dalne lage. Phir jab us se ghabrahat hoti to use apne chehre se hata dete. Phir Aap ne farmaya, jabke Aap aise hi they: Allah ki lanat Yahood aur Nasara par, unhon ne apne Ambiya ki qabron ko masjidein banaya. Aap un ke kiye se darate they."
"309","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Affan se Ubaidullah al-Khaulani ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Usman bin Affan ko kehte suna, logon ke un ke bare mein kehne par, jab unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki masjid banayi: Beshak tum ne kasrat ki, aur beshak main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo Allah ka chehra chahte hue masjid banaye, Allah us ke liye Jannat mein is jaisi banayega."
"310","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Mus'ab bin Sa'd ne kaha: Main ne apne walid ke pehlu mein namaz parhi aur apni dono hatheliyon ko milaya, phir unhe apni dono ranon ke darmiyan rakha. To mere walid ne mujhe mana kiya aur farmaya: Hum aisa karte they. Phir hamein is se mana kiya gaya, aur hamein hukm diya gaya ke hum apne hath ghutnon par rakhein."
"311","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko salam karte jabke Wo namaz mein hote to Wo hamein jawab dete. Phir jab hum Najashi ke paas se laute to hum ne Aap ko salam kiya to Aap ne hamein jawab na diya. Aur farmaya: Beshak namaz mein mashghooliyat hai."
"312","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum namaz mein baat karte, hum mein se ek apne bhai se apni hajat mein baat karta, yahan tak ke ye ayat nazil hui [namazon ki hifazat karo aur darmiyani namaz ki, aur Allah ke liye khamoshi se khade ho]. Phir hamein khamoshi ka hukm diya gaya."
"313","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe apni ek hajat mein bheja. To main chala, phir lauta jab main use poora kar chuka tha. Phir main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko salam kiya. To Aap ne mujhe jawab na diya. Phir mere dil mein wo pada jo Allah zyada janta hai. Phir main ne apne dil mein kaha: Shayad Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujh par naraaz hue ke main Aap par der se aaya. Phir main ne Aap ko salam kiya to Aap ne mujhe jawab na diya. Phir mere dil mein pehli martaba se zyada pada. Phir main ne Aap ko salam kiya to Aap ne mujhe jawab diya. Aur farmaya: Mujhe tumhe jawab dene se sirf is ne roka ke main namaz parh raha tha. Aur Aap apni sawari par Qibla ke siwa kisi aur taraf mutawajjah they."
"314","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak jinon mein se ek sarkash jin kal raat mujh par toota taake meri namaz kaat de. To Allah ne mujhe us par قابو diya. Phir main ne irada kiya ke use masjid ke sutunon mein se ek sutun se bandh dun yahan tak ke tum subah karo aur tum sab use dekho. Phir mujhe mere bhai Sulaiman ka qaul yaad aaya [ae mere Rab! Mujhe aisi badshahi de jo mere baad kisi ke liye jayez na ho]. Phir us ne use nakaam lautaya."
"315","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz parhte jabke Aap Umama bint Zainab bint Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko uthaye they, jo Abu al-Aas bin Rabi'a bin Abd Shams se thein. Phir jab Aap sajda karte to use rakh dete, aur jab khade hote to use utha lete."
"316","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd al-Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Abu Hazim bin Dinar ne kaha: Kuchh log Sahl bin Sa'd al-Sa'idi ke paas aaye jabke unhon ne mimbar ke bare mein ikhtilaf kiya tha ke us ki lakdi kis se hai. To unhon ne un se is ke bare mein poochha. To unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main janta hun wo kis se hai. Aur beshak main ne use pehle din dekha jab rakha gaya, aur pehle din jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us par baithe. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne falan aurat ki taraf bheja [ek aurat jis ka Sahl ne naam liya]: Apne badhayi ghulam ko hukm do ke mere liye lakdiyan banaye jin par main baithun jab logon se kalam karun. Phir us ne use hukm diya to us ne use jungle ke jhau se banaya. Phir wo use lekar aaya. Phir us ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf bheja. To Aap ne us ka hukm farmaya aur wo yahan rakha gaya. Phir main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke Aap ne us par namaz parhi, takbeer kahi jabke Aap us par they, phir ruku kiya jabke Aap us par they, phir peechhe hat kar utre. Phir mimbar ki jad mein sajda kiya, phir laute. Phir jab Aap farigh hue to logon ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: Ae logon! Main ne ye sirf is liye kiya taake tum pairwi karo aur meri namaz seekho."
"317","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mana kiya gaya ke aadmi dayein-bayein dekh kar namaz parhe."
"318","[AI-translation] Mu'aiqib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us shakhs ke bare mein farmaya jo mitti barabar karta hai jahan sajda karta hai, Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum karne wale ho to ek martaba."
"319","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Qibla ki deewar mein thook dekha to use khurcha. Phir logon ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parh raha ho to apne chehre ke samne na thooke, kyunke Allah us ke chehre ke samne hai jab wo namaz parhta hai."
"320","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne masjid ke Qibla mein balgham dekha to use kankari se khurcha. Phir mana farmaya ke aadmi apne samne ya apne dayein thooke, lekin apne bayein ya apne bayein paon ke neeche."
"321","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah aur Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne masjid ki deewar mein balgham dekha to kankari li aur use khurcha. Phir farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi nak saaf kare to apne chehre ke samne nak saaf na kare, na apne dayein, aur use chahiye ke apne bayein ya apne bayein paon ke neeche thooke."
"322","[AI-translation] Umm al-Muminin Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Qibla ki deewar mein resha, ya thook, ya balgham dekha to use khurcha."
"323","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak momin jab namaz mein hota hai to wo apne Rab se sargoshi karta hai. To wo apne samne hargiz na thooke aur na apne dayein, lekin apne bayein ya apne paon ke neeche."
"324","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Masjid mein thookna gunah hai aur us ka kaffara use dafan karna hai."
"325","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik se Sa'id bin Yazid al-Azdi ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas bin Malik se poochha: Kya Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne jooton mein namaz parhte they? Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"326","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek chadar mein namaz parhi jis mein nishan they. To Aap ne farmaya: Is ke nishanon ne mujhe mashghool kar diya. Use Abu Jahm ke paas le jao aur mere paas saadi chadar lao."
"327","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab raat ka khana rakha jaye aur namaz khadi ki jaye to khane se ibtida karo."
"328","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab raat ka khana pesh kiya jaye to Maghrib ki namaz parhne se pehle us se ibtida karo. Aur apne khane se jaldi na karo."
"329","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab raat ka khana rakha jaye aur namaz khadi ki jaye to khane se ibtida karo."
"330","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka raat ka khana rakha jaye aur namaz khadi ki jaye to khane se ibtida karo. Aur wo jaldi na kare yahan tak ke us se farigh ho jaye."
"331","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar ki ladayi mein farmaya: Jo is darakht mein se khaye, matlab lehsan, wo hamari masjid ke qareeb na aaye."
"332","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se Abd al-Aziz ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Anas se poochha: Tum ne Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se lehsan ke bare mein kya suna hai? To unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo is darakht mein se khaye wo hamare qareeb na aaye ya hamare sath namaz na parhe."
"333","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne dawa kiya ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo lehsan ya pyaz khaye wo hum se alag rahe, ya farmaya wo hamari masjid se alag rahe aur apne ghar mein baithe. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas ek handi layi gayi jis mein sabziyon mein se sabziyan thein. To Aap ne us ki boo payi. Phir Aap ne poochha to Aap ko khabar di gayi jo us mein sabziyon mein se tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Use mere kuchh sathiyon ke qareeb karo jo mere sath they. Phir jab us ne dekha ke Aap ne us ka khana na-pasand kiya to us ne kaha: Khayiye, kyunke main us se sargoshi karta hun jis se tum sargoshi nahi karte."
"334","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz ke liye pukara jaye to shaitan peeth pher kar bhagta hai jabke us se hawa kharij hoti hai taake wo azan na sune. Phir jab azan poori ho jati hai to wapas aata hai. Phir jab us ke liye iqamat kahi jati hai to peeth pher kar bhagta hai. Phir jab iqamat poori ho jati hai to wapas aata hai. Yahan tak ke aadmi aur us ke dil ke darmiyan khayal dalta hai. Kehta hai: Falan aur falan yaad karo, jo wo yaad na karta tha. Yahan tak ke aadmi is haal mein rehta hai agar wo nahi janta ke us ne kitni parhi. Phir jab tum mein se koi nahi janta ke us ne kitni parhi, teen ya chaar, to use chahiye ke baith kar do sajde kare."
"335","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Buhaina (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein kuchh namazon mein se do rakatein parhayein, phir khade ho gaye aur na baithe. Phir log Aap ke sath khade ho gaye. Phir jab Aap ne apni namaz poori ki aur hum ne Aap ka salam dekha to Aap ne salam se pehle takbeer kahi. Phir baith kar do sajde kiye, phir salam phera."
"336","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne namaz parhayi [Ibrahim ne kaha, hadith ke ek rawi, main nahi janta zyada ki ya kam ki]. Phir jab Aap ne salam phera to Aap se arz kiya gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya namaz mein koi nayi cheez hui hai? Aap ne farmaya: Wo kya hai? Unhon ne arz kiya: Aap ne itni aur itni parhi. Phir Aap ne apne dono paon mode aur Qibla ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur do sajde kiye, phir salam phera. Phir jab Aap apne chehre se hamari taraf mutawajjah hue to farmaya: Beshak agar namaz mein koi nayi cheez hoti to main tumhe khabar deta. Lekin main to tumhare jaisa bashar hun, bhoolta hun jaise tum bhoolte ho. Phir jab main bhoolun to mujhe yaad dilao. Aur jab tum mein se koi apni namaz mein shak kare to use chahiye ke durust ka irada kare aur us par poora kare, phir salam phere, phir do sajde kare."
"337","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein Zuhr do rakatein parhayein, phir salam phera. Phir masjid ke agle hisse mein lakdi ki taraf khade hue aur apna hath us par rakha. Aur qaum mein us din Abu Bakr aur Umar they to wo Aap se baat karne se dare. Aur logon mein se jaldi wale nikle aur arz kiya: Namaz kam kar di gayi. Aur qaum mein ek shakhs tha jise Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Dhu al-Yadain kehte they. To us ne arz kiya: Ae Nabiullah! Kya tum bhool gaye ya kam hui? To Aap ne farmaya: Na main bhoola aur na kam hui. Unhon ne arz kiya: Balke tum bhool gaye Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Dhu al-Yadain ne sach kaha. Phir Aap khade hue aur do rakatein parhein phir salam phera. Phir takbeer kahi aur apne sajde jaisa ya us se lamba sajda kiya. Phir apna sar uthaya aur takbeer kahi. Phir apne sajde jaisa ya us se lamba rakha. Phir apna sar uthaya aur takbeer kahi."
"338","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamein surat parhte jis mein sajda hota. To Aap sajda karte aur hum sajda karte, yahan tak ke hum mein se koi apni peshani ki jagah na pata."
"339","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Makkah mein Najm parhi aur us mein sajda kiya. Aur jo Aap ke sath they unhon ne sajda kiya, siwaye ek budhe ke jis ne kankariyon ya mitti ki ek mutthi li aur use apni peshani tak uthaya aur kaha: Mujhe ye kafi hai. Phir main ne use baad mein dekha ke wo kafir qatl hua."
"340","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Thabit se Ata bin Yasar ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Zaid bin Thabit (raziyallahu anhu) se poochha. To unhon ne dawa kiya ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Najm parh kar sunayi to Aap ne us mein sajda na farmaya."
"341","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah se Abu Rafi ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ke sath Isha parhi. To unhon ne [jab aasman phat jayega] parhi aur sajda kiya. To main ne arz kiya: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Qasim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechhe is mein sajda kiya. To main ise sajda karta rahunga yahan tak ke Aap se milun."
"342","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz ke khatm hone ko takbeer se pehchanta tha."
"343","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Madina ki Yahood ki budhiyon mein se do budhiyan mere paas aayein. To un dono ne mujh se kaha: Beshak qabr walon ko un ki qabron mein azab diya jata hai. To main ne un dono ko jhutlaya aur un dono ki tasdeeq ko pasand na kiya. Phir wo dono niklein aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas dakhil hue. To main ne Aap se arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak do budhiyan, aur main ne Aap se zikr kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Un dono ne sach kaha. Beshak unhe aisa azab diya jata hai jise tamam janwar sunte hain. Phir main ne Aap ko is ke baad namaz mein nahi dekha magar Aap qabr ke azab se panah mangte."
"344","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apni namaz mein Dajjal ke fitne se panah mangte suna."
"345","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz mein dua farmate: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah mangta hun qabr ke azab se, Teri panah mangta hun Masih Dajjal ke fitne se, Teri panah mangta hun zindagi ke fitne aur maut ke fitne se. Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah mangta hun gunah aur qarz se. Phir Aap se ek kehne wale ne kaha: Tum qarz se kitni panah mangte ho? To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak aadmi jab qarz-dar hota hai to baat karta hai aur jhoot bolta hai, wada karta hai aur khilaf-warzi karta hai."
"346","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dua farmate: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah mangta hun qabr ke azab se aur Aag ke azab se, zindagi aur maut ke fitne se, aur Masih Dajjal ke fitne se."
"347","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughira bin Shu'ba se Warrad katib Mughira bin Shu'ba ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mughira bin Shu'ba ne Muawiya ki taraf khat mein mujhe likhwaya ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) har farz namaz ke peechhe kehte: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, Wo akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahi. Us ke liye badshahi hai aur Us ke liye hamd hai, aur Wo har cheez par qadir hai. Ae Allah! Jo Tune diya use rokne wala koi nahi, aur jo Tune roka use dene wala koi nahi. Aur koshish wale ko Tujh se us ki koshish faida nahi deti."
"348","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Faqeer Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur arz kiya: Maal wale buland darje aur hamesha rehne wali naimat lekar gaye. Wo namaz parhte hain jaise hum namaz parhte hain aur roze rakhte hain jaise hum roze rakhte hain. Aur unhe maalon mein fazilat hai jis se wo hajj karte hain, umra karte hain, jihad karte hain aur sadqa karte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhe aisi cheez na bataun ke agar tum ne use apnaya to tum un se mil jao jo tum se aage badh gaye aur tumhe koi baad wala na paye, aur tum un mein sab se behtar ho jin ke darmiyan tum ho, siwaye jo is jaisa amal kare? Tum har namaz ke peechhe taintees martaba tasbeeh, hamd aur takbeer kaho. Phir hum ne baham ikhtilaf kiya. To hum mein se kuchh ne kaha: Hum taintees martaba tasbeeh kahenge, taintees martaba hamd kahenge aur chauntees martaba takbeer kahenge. Phir main Aap ki taraf lauta to Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: SubhanAllah, Alhamdulillah aur Allahu Akbar, yahan tak ke un sab mein se taintees ho jayein."
"349","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) takbeer aur qiraat ke darmiyan halki khamoshi ikhtiyar farmate. To main ne arz kiya: Mere maan-baap Aap par fida hon Ya Rasulullah! Takbeer aur qiraat ke darmiyan Aap ki khamoshi, tum kya kehte ho? Aap ne farmaya: Main kehta hun: Ae Allah! Mere aur meri khatayon ke darmiyan doori farma jaise Tune mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan doori farmayi. Ae Allah! Mujhe khatayon se paak farma jaise safed kapda mail se paak kiya jata hai. Ae Allah! Meri khatayon ko pani, barf aur oolon se dho de."
"350","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jab namaz khadi ki jaye to us ke paas daudte hue na aao aur us ke paas chalte hue aao. Tum par sukoon lazim hai. Phir jo tum payo wo parho aur jo tum se reh jaye use poora karo."
"351","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath namaz parh rahe they to Aap ne mardon ka shor suna. Phir jab Aap ne namaz parh li to farmaya: Tumhara kya haal hai? Unhon ne arz kiya: Hum namaz ke liye jaldi mein they. Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na karo. Jab tum namaz ke paas aao to tum par sukoon lazim hai. Phir jo tum payo wo parho aur jo tum se reh jaye use poora karo."
"352","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Namaz khadi ki gayi aur safein khade hokar seedhi ki gayein. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare paas nikle. Phir jab Aap apni namaz ki jagah khade hue to Aap ko yaad aaya ke Aap junbi hain. To Aap ne hum se farmaya: Apni jagah raho. Phir Aap laute aur ghusl farmaya. Phir hamare paas nikle jabke Aap ka sar tapak raha tha. Phir takbeer kahi aur hum ne Aap ke sath namaz parhi."
"353","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo namaz ki ek rakat paye us ne namaz pa li."
"354","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jibreel nazil hue aur mujhe imamat karayi. Phir main ne un ke sath namaz parhi, phir main ne un ke sath namaz parhi, phir main ne un ke sath namaz parhi, phir main ne un ke sath namaz parhi, phir main ne un ke sath namaz parhi. Aap apni ungliyon se paanch namazein ginte."
"355","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud al-Ansari se Ibn Shihab ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Abd al-Aziz ne ek din namaz muakkhar ki. To Urwa bin al-Zubair un ke paas dakhil hue. Phir unhon ne unhe khabar di ke Mughira bin Shu'ba ne ek din namaz muakkhar ki jabke wo Iraq mein they. To Abu Mas'ud al-Ansari un ke paas dakhil hue aur farmaya: Ae Mughira! Ye kya hai? Kya tum nahi jante ke Jibreel (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nazil hue aur namaz parhi to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne namaz parhi, phir namaz parhi to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne namaz parhi, phir namaz parhi to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne namaz parhi, phir namaz parhi to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne namaz parhi, phir namaz parhi to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne namaz parhi. Phir farmaya: Mujhe isi ka hukm diya gaya hai. Phir Umar ne Urwa se kaha: Jano jo tum bayan karte ho. Kya Jibreel ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye namaz ka waqt qayam kiya? To Urwa ne kaha: Bashir bin Abi Mas'ud apne walid se aisa hi bayan karte they."
"356","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Asr parhte jabke suraj un ke hujre mein hota, zahir hone se pehle."
"357","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab garmi sakht ho to namaz thandi karke parho, kyunke garmi ki sakhti Jahannam ki lapak se hai."
"358","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke muazzin ne Zuhr ki azan kahi. To Aap ne farmaya: Thanda karo, thanda karo. Ya farmaya: Intezar karo, intezar karo. Aur farmaya: Garmi ki sakhti Jahannam ki lapak se hai. Phir jab garmi sakht ho to namaz thandi karke parho, yahan tak ke hum ne teelon ka saya dekha."
"359","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aag ne apne Rab se shikayat ki. To us ne kaha: Ae mere Rab! Mera ek hissa doosre ko kha gaya. To Us ne use do saanson ki ijazat di: Sardiyon mein ek saans aur garmiyon mein ek saans. Phir ye garmi mein jo sab se sakht tum pate ho, aur sardi mein jo sab se sakht tum pate ho."
"360","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath sakht garmi mein namaz parhte. Phir jab hum mein se koi apne chehre ko zameen par jamane ki taqat na rakhta to apna kapda bichhata aur us par sajda karta."
"361","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Asr parhte jabke suraj buland aur zinda hota. Phir jane wala Awali ki taraf jata aur un ke paas aata jabke suraj buland hota. Aur Awali mein se kuchh Madina se chaar meel par hai, ya is ke qareeb."
"362","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik se Abu Umama ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Umar bin Abd al-Aziz ke sath Zuhr parhi. Phir hum nikle yahan tak ke Anas bin Malik ke paas dakhil hue. To hum ne unhe Asr parhte paya. To main ne arz kiya: Ae chacha! Ye kaun si namaz hai jo tum ne parhi? Unhon ne kaha: Asr, aur ye Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz hai jo hum Aap ke sath parhte they."
"363","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi bin Khadij (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Asr parhte, phir oont zibah karte aur dus hisson mein taqseem karte. Phir pake hue gosht khate, suraj ghuroob hone se pehle."
"364","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ki Asr ki namaz reh jaye goya us ke ghar wale aur maal cheen liye gaye."
"365","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Ahzab ka din tha to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah un ke gharon aur qabron ko aag se bhar de. Unhon ne hamein darmiyani namaz se rok diya yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob ho gaya."
"366","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) Khandaq ke din suraj ghuroob hone ke baad aaye aur Quraish ke kafiron ko gali dene lage. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main Asr na parh saka yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob hone lagi. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Main ne use nahi parha. Phir hum Buthan ki taraf uthe. Phir Aap ne namaz ke liye wuzu farmaya aur hum ne us ke liye wuzu kiya. Phir Aap ne suraj ghuroob hone ke baad Asr parhi, phir us ke baad Maghrib parhi."
"367","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein raat ke farishte aur din ke farishte baham aate-jate hain. Aur wo Fajr ki namaz aur Asr ki namaz mein jama hote hain. Phir jo tum mein raat guzarte hain wo upar jate hain. Phir un ka Rab un se poochhta hai, jabke Wo unhe zyada janta hai: Tum ne mere bandon ko kaise chhora? To wo arz karte hain: Hum ne unhe chhora jabke wo namaz parh rahe they, aur hum un ke paas aaye jabke wo namaz parh rahe they."
"368","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas they. Phir Aap ne raat mein chaand ki taraf dekha, matlab chaundhween ka. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum anqareeb apne Rab ko dekhoge jaise tum is chaand ko dekhte ho, tum usے dekhne mein takleef nahi uthaoge. Phir agar tum taqat rakho ke tum suraj tulu hone se pehle aur us ke ghuroob hone se pehle namaz par maghloob na ho to aisa karo. Phir Aap ne parha: [Aur apne Rab ki hamd se tasbeeh karo suraj tulu hone se pehle aur ghuroob se pehle]."
"369","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo thandi do namazein parhe wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"370","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Maghrib parhte jab wo parde mein chhup jata."
"371","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi bin Khadij (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Maghrib parhte. Phir hum mein se ek laut-ta jabke wo apne teeron ke girne ki jagah dekhta."
"372","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek raat Isha mein der ki, aur ye Islam ke phailne se pehle tha. Phir Aap na nikle yahan tak ke Umar ne kaha: Auratein aur bachche so gaye. Phir Aap nikle aur masjid walon se farmaya: Zameen walon mein se tumhare siwa koi is ka intezar nahi karta."
"373","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek raat is se mashghool hue. To Aap ne use muakkhar kiya yahan tak ke hum masjid mein so gaye. Phir hum bedar hue, phir so gaye, phir bedar hue. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare paas nikle. Phir farmaya: Zameen walon mein se tumhare siwa koi namaz ka intezar nahi karta."
"374","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Humaid ne kaha: Anas se poochha gaya: Kya Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne angoothi banayi? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne ek raat Isha ki namaz aadhi raat tak muakkhar ki. Phir Aap apne chehre se hamari taraf mutawajjah hue, goya main Aap ki angoothi ki chamak dekh raha hun. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak logon ne namaz parh li aur so gaye. Aur beshak tum namaz mein hi rahe jab tak tum ne us ka intezar kiya."
"375","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aur mere sathi jo mere sath kashti mein aaye they, Baqi Buthan mein thehre they, jabke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina mein they. Phir har raat Isha ki namaz mein un mein se ek giroh Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas ata-jata tha. Phir main aur mere sathi Nabi (alaihissalam) ke paas aaye jabke Aap ko apne ek kaam mein kuchh mashghooliyat thi. Phir Aap ne namaz mein der ki yahan tak ke raat andheri ho gayi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nikle aur unhe namaz parhayi. Phir jab Aap ne apni namaz poori ki to jo hazir they un se farmaya: Thehro, khush ho jao. Beshak tum par Allah ki naimat mein se hai ke logon mein se tumhare siwa koi is ghadi namaz nahi parhta. Ya farmaya: Tumhare siwa kisi ne is ghadi namaz nahi parhi. Abu Musa ne kaha: Phir hum us se khush hue jo hum ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna."
"376","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek raat Isha mein der ki yahan tak ke log so gaye aur bedar hue, so gaye aur bedar hue. Phir Umar bin al-Khattab khade hue aur farmaya: Namaz. Phir Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nikle, goya main Aap ko ab dekh raha hun, Aap ka sar pani tapak raha hai, apna hath apne sar par rakhe. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Agar main apni ummat par mushqqat na dalta to unhe hukm deta ke wo ise aise parhein [Ibn Juraij ne kaha, jo Ata se riwayat karte hain, jo Ibn Abbas se riwayat karte hain]: Phir main ne Ata se pukhta kiya ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne sar par apna hath kaise rakha jaisa Ibn Abbas ne unhe khabar di thi. Phir Ata ne mere liye apni ungliyon ke darmiyan kuchh kushadgi ki, phir apni ungliyon ke kinare sar ke jod par rakhe, phir unhe milaya, unhe aise sar par pherte yahan tak ke un ka angootha chehre ki taraf kaan ke kinare kanpati aur dadhi ke hisse ko chhua. Na kami karte aur na pakadte magar aise hi. Aur farmaya: Agar main apni ummat par mushqqat na dalta to unhe hukm deta ke wo ise aise parhein."
"377","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Momin aurtein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Fajr ki namaz mein hazir hoti thein jabke unhon ne apni chadarein odhi hoti thein. Phir apne gharon ki taraf laut-ti thein jab namaz poori kar leti thein, andhere se unhe koi na pehchanta."
"378","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Zuhr dopahar ki sakht garmi mein parhte, Asr jabke suraj saaf hota, Maghrib jab wajib ho jata, aur Isha kabhi aur kabhi: Jab Aap unhe jama dekhte to jaldi farmate, jab unhe der karte dekhte to muakkhar farmate. Aur Fajr, wo they, ya Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) use andhere mein parhte."
"379","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Barza al-Aslami (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, un se namazon ke waqt ke bare mein poochha gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Zuhr parhte jab suraj dhal jata, Asr, aur aadmi Madina ke door tareen hisse ki taraf laut-ta jabke suraj zinda hota [Abu Barza se rawi ne kaha: Aur main bhool gaya jo unhon ne Maghrib ke bare mein kaha]. Aur Isha ko raat ke tihayi tak muakkhar karne ki parwah na karte. Aur us se pehle sone aur us ke baad baat karne ko pasand na farmate. Aur Fajr parhte, phir aadmi laut-ta aur apne sathi ko pehchanta. Aur do rakaton mein ya un mein se ek mein saath se sau tak parhte."
"380","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jamaat ki namaz tum mein se kisi ki akele namaz se pachees hisson se fazilat rakhti hai. Aur raat ke farishte aur din ke farishte Fajr ki namaz mein jama hote hain. Phir Abu Hurairah kehte: Phir parho agar chaho [beshak Fajr ka Quran hazir kiya gaya hai]."
"381","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jamaat ki namaz akele ki namaz se sattais darjon se fazilat rakhti hai."
"382","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak main ne irada kiya ke lakdiyon ka hukm dun aur wo jama ki jayein, phir namaz ka hukm dun aur us ke liye azan kahi jaye, phir ek shakhs ko hukm dun ke wo logon ki imamat kare, phir mardon ki taraf jaun aur un par un ke ghar jala dun. Aur Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Agar un mein se ek janta ke wo moti nali, ya do achhi khur wali cheezein payega to Isha mein zaroor hazir hota."
"383","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Munafiqon par Fajr aur Isha se bhari koi namaz nahi. Aur agar wo jante jo un dono mein hai to un dono mein aate agarche ghisat kar. Beshak main ne irada kiya ke muazzin ko hukm dun aur wo iqamat kahe, phir ek shakhs ko hukm dun ke wo logon ki imamat kare, phir aag ke sholey lun aur jo namaz ke liye abhi na nikle us par jala dun."
"384","[AI-translation] Itban bin Malik se riwayat hai, jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sathiyon mein se hain, Ansar mein se jo Badr mein hazir hue, ke wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Meri nazar kamzor ho gayi hai, aur main apni qaum ko namaz parhata hun. Phir jab barishein hoti hain to wo wadi jo mere aur un ke darmiyan hai behne lagti hai. To main un ki masjid mein aakar unhe namaz na parha sakta. Aur main chahta hun Ya Rasulullah! Ke tum mere paas aao aur mere ghar mein namaz parho to main use namaz ki jagah banaun. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Main karunga agar Allah ne chaha. Itban ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Abu Bakr din chadhne par subah aaye. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ijazat mangi to main ne Aap ko ijazat di. Phir Aap na baithe yahan tak ke ghar mein dakhil hue. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Tum kahan pasand karte ho ke main tumhare ghar mein namaz parhun? Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne Aap ko ghar ke ek kone ki taraf ishara kiya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khade hue aur takbeer kahi. Phir hum khade hue aur saf bandhi. Phir Aap ne do rakatein parhayein phir salam phera. Unhon ne kaha: Aur hum ne Aap ko khazeera par rok liya jo hum ne Aap ke liye banaya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ghar mein ghar walon mein se chand mard jama ho gaye aur ikatthe hue. Phir un mein se ek kehne wale ne kaha: Malik bin al-Dukhaishin kahan hai, ya Ibn al-Dukhshun? Phir un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Wo munafiq hai jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool se mohabbat nahi karta. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aisa na kaho. Kya tum nahi dekhte ke us ne La ilaha illallah kaha hai, is se Allah ka chehra chahte hue? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak hum us ka chehra aur us ki hamdardi munafiqon ki taraf dekhte hain. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne Aag par usے haram kiya hai jo La ilaha illallah kahe, is se Allah ka chehra chahte hue."
"385","[AI-translation] Mahmud bin al-Rabi se riwayat hai, unhon ne dawa kiya ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko yaad rakha, aur us kulli ko yaad rakha jo Aap ne us dol se ki jo un ke ghar mein tha. Phir unhon ne Itban ki pichhli hadith bayan ki."
"386","[AI-translation] Hazrat Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz parhte jabke main Aap ke barabar hoti, aur main haiz se hoti. Aur kabhi jab Aap sajda karte to Aap ka kapda mujhe lagta. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap chatai par namaz parhte."
"387","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jamaat ki namaz us ki ghar mein namaz aur us ki bazar mein namaz se pachees darje zyada hai. Phir beshak tum mein se jab koi wuzu kare aur acha kare, aur masjid aaye aur sirf namaz ka irada rakhe, to wo koi qadam na uthaye magar Allah us se us ka darja buland karega aur us se gunah mitayega, yahan tak ke wo masjid mein dakhil ho. Aur jab wo masjid mein dakhil ho to namaz mein rehta hai jab tak use roke. Aur farishte us par dua karte hain jab tak wo apni us majlis mein rahe jismein wo namaz parhta hai: Ae Allah! Use bakhsh de, ae Allah! Us par rehem farma, jab tak wo is mein be-wuzu na ho."
"388","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Namaz mein ajr mein sab se bade log wo hain jo sab se door, phir sab se door chalte hain. Aur jo namaz ka intezar kare yahan tak ke use imam ke sath parhe wo us se ajr mein bada hai jo namaz parhe phir so jaye."
"389","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Batayo, agar tum mein se kisi ke darwaze par ek nahar ho jis mein wo har din paanch martaba ghusl kare, to tum kya kehte ho, kya ye us ke mail mein se kuchh baqi rakhegi? Unhon ne arz kiya: Wo us ke mail mein se kuchh baqi nahi rakhegi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir ye paanch namazon ki misal hai, Allah un se khatayein mitata hai."
"390","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo subah aur shaam masjid jaye, Allah us ke liye Jannat mein us ki mezbani tayyar karega, jab bhi wo subah ya shaam jaye."
"391","[AI-translation] Hazrat Malik bin al-Huwairith (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main apni qaum mein se ek jamaat ke sath Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya. Phir hum Aap ke paas bees raatein thehre. Aur Aap narm-dil aur narm they. Phir jab Aap ne hamare ghar walon ka shauq dekha to farmaya: Laut jao aur un mein raho, unhe sikhayo aur namaz parho. Phir jab namaz ka waqt aaye to tum mein se ek tumhe azan kahe, aur tum mein se bada tumhari imamat kare."
"392","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab apna sar uthate to farmate: Allah ne us ki sun li jo Us ki hamd kare. Ae hamare Rab! Tere liye hamd hai. Mardon ke liye dua farmate aur unhe un ke naamon se pukarte. Phir farmate: Ae Allah! Walid bin al-Walid, Salama bin Hisham, Ayyash bin Abi Rabi'a aur mominon mein se kamzoron ko najaat de. Ae Allah! Muzar par apna dabao sakht farma, aur use un par Yusuf ke saalon jaise saal bana de. Aur mashriq wale us din Muzar mein se Aap ke mukhalif they."
"393","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek mahina qunut parhi, Ri'l aur Dhakwan par bad-dua farmate hue."
"394","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se Asim ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se qunut ke bare mein poochha. Unhon ne kaha: Ruku se pehle. To main ne kaha: Beshak falan dawa karta hai ke tum ne kaha ke ruku ke baad. To unhon ne kaha: Us ne jhoot bola. Phir unhon ne hamein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kiya ke Aap ne ruku ke baad ek mahina qunut parhi, Bani Sulaim ke chand qabeelon par bad-dua farmate hue. Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne qariyon mein se chalees ya sattar [is mein shak hai] mushrikon mein se kuchh logon ki taraf bheje. Phir inhon ne un ka samna kiya aur unhe qatl kar diya. Aur un ke aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke darmiyan ahad tha. Phir main ne Aap ko kisi par itna ghussa farmate nahi dekha jitna Aap ne un par ghussa farmaya."
"395","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek lashkar bheja jinhe Qari kaha jata hai. Phir wo shaheed kiye gaye. Phir main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kisi cheez par itna ghussa farmate nahi dekha jitna Aap ne un par ghussa farmaya. Phir Aap ne Fajr ki namaz mein ek mahina qunut parhi. Aur farmate: Beshak Usayya ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki na-farmani ki."
"396","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek safar mein they. Phir unhon ne apni raat ko safar kiya, yahan tak ke jab subah ka waqt hua to wo utre. Phir un ki aankhein un par ghalib aa gayein yahan tak ke suraj buland ho gaya. Phir apni neend se bedar hone mein sab se pehle Abu Bakr they. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko un ki neend se jagaya na jata tha yahan tak ke Wo bedar hon. Phir Umar bedar hue. Phir Abu Bakr un ke sar ke paas baithe. Phir wo takbeer kehne lage aur apni awaz buland karne lage yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bedar ho gaye. Phir Aap utre aur hamein Fajr parhayi. Phir qaum mein se ek shakhs alag hua jis ne hamare sath namaz na parhi. Phir jab Aap phire to farmaya: Ae falan! Tumhe hamare sath namaz parhne se kya rokta hai? Us ne arz kiya: Mujhe janabat lahق hui hai. To Aap ne use mitti se tayammum ka hukm diya. Phir us ne namaz parhi. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe apne samne sawari mein rakha. Aur hum sakht pyase hue they. Phir jab hum chal rahe they to ek aurat apne dono paon do mashkeezon ke darmiyan latkaye hue. Phir hum ne us se kaha: Pani kahan hai? To us ne kaha: Beshak pani nahi hai. Phir hum ne kaha: Tumhare ghar walon aur pani ke darmiyan kitna hai? Us ne kaha: Ek din aur ek raat. Phir hum ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas chalo. Us ne kaha: Rasulullah kya hai? Phir hum ne use us ke mamle mein ikhtiyar na diya yahan tak ke hum use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laye. Phir us ne Aap se waisa hi bayan kiya jaisa hum se bayan kiya tha, magar us ne Aap se bayan kiya ke wo yateemon wali hai. Phir Aap ne us ki dono mashkeezo ka hukm diya. Phir Aap ne dono dahano mein masah kiya. Phir hum ne piya jabke hum pyase they, chalees mard, yahan tak ke hum sairab ho gaye. Phir hum ne apni har mashk aur bartan bhar liya, magar hum ne oont ko pani na pilaya. Jabke wo bharne se phatne ke qareeb thi. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Jo tumhare paas hai lao. Phir us ke liye roti ke tukde aur khajoor jama kiye gaye, yahan tak ke wo apne ghar walon ke paas aayi. Phir us ne kaha: Main sab se bade jadugar se mili hun, ya wo Nabi hain jaisa wo kehte hain. Phir Allah ne us aurat ke zariye us qabeelay ko hidayat di. Phir wo musalman hui aur wo musalman hue."
"397","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo namaz bhool jaye use chahiye ke jab yaad aaye parhe. Us ka is ke siwa koi kaffara nahi. [Aur meri yaad ke liye namaz qayam karo]."
